Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿斯特拉尔)至今为止
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我收集到的 No.卡是50张。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的还差50张{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凑齐100张 No.卡的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}飞散的记忆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.07,0:00:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会全部苏醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米迦勒)多鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)米迦勒。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然靠基拉古和阿里特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.99,0:01:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是谈不出结果的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.27,0:01:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，事已至此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来只能让你去一趟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我本来就打算这么做。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把这个带上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.80,0:01:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}屏障球体。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虽然只是暂时的，但用了这个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能产生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.11,0:01:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}球体领域。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。在球体领域里的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.66,0:01:30.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算是在人类的世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们巴利安也能以原本的力量战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。也省去了洗脑操纵人类的麻烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:40.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接和九十九游马决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.39,0:01:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}靠我们自己的手就能回收 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}本来觉得没必要用这个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但事已至此 也没办法了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.96,0:01:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三个当中一个给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.36,0:01:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}剩下的就交给基拉古和阿里特吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对他们来说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.76,0:02:00.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这算是最后的机会了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.83,0:02:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.70,0:02:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就拜托你了 米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}务必打倒九十九游马
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回收 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一切 都是为了巴利安世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了，米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子，净会给人添麻烦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.65,0:05:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是梦吗……就算是梦，也太逼真了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么能被区区一个梦吓到！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.11,0:06:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去，我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的能保护好星光体吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(有栖)抽卡！抽卡……！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.47,0:06:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)抽卡！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.86,0:06:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1头熊变为守备表示，回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行了不行了，真的不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.12,0:06:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古，你这副样子是怎么回事。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.88,0:07:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！我这边可是在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陪你修炼啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好歹给我有点感激之情吧……。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.49,0:07:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)什……什么啊那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是从异晶界来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.11,0:07:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(基拉古)他到底想干什么啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.60,0:07:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(阿里特)这么张扬的做法……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这股强大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是那家伙……那家伙来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.42,0:07:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}米扎艾尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.51,0:08:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界球形立方体。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说 有了这个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在一段时间内
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能张开球形力场了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是帮大忙了这样就能和游马全力一战了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:15.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}之前一直都得把那些没出息的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}洗脑才行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于能拿出真本事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 你就尽量加油吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 米扎艾尔 你这家伙打算怎么办……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 真是个让人不爽的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(真月)我这是为你好才问一下的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 是怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.54,0:08:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得今天看起来没什么精神的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)从早上开始就是那副样子呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:48.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也看不到星光体的身影。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.95,0:08:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(明里)果然奶奶的土豆炖肉最棒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.67,0:08:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗？多吃点。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:08:58.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我吃饱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(春)哦呀 已经吃不下了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有点没食欲。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)哎～！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《接二连三袭来的巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.70,0:09:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙使用的混沌超量是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.35,0:09:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被巴利安之力特殊召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它会吸收我们这边怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.46,0:09:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，我们这边每被吸收
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.35,0:09:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力还会下降300点。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.76,0:09:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}光是这样，我们这边就处于压倒性的劣势了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得想…得想个办法对抗那家伙才行。不然的话，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，不然的话，我…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，快点快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等… 等一下等等我啊，喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么是我去决斗庵跑腿啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（（哎？这次连休
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和游马一起去决斗庵跑腿？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线电]游马那家伙，最近这段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直没什么精神啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.01,0:10:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[无线电]好像有什么烦恼的样子{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去呼吸下山里的空气，多少也能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我想着这样能让你散散心。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了，既然是这样的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，为什么是我呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你问为什么，这个嘛……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.79,0:10:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不要啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.02,0:10:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，春奶奶也真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打扰了～
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.44,0:11:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，暗川先生！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.96,0:11:13.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（暗川）好久不见了，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样啊，是春女士让你来的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干嘛啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好不容易费了那么大劲给你送过来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六十郎爷爷不在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉啊。师父前几天突然出门旅行去了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到现在还没回来。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.74,0:11:32.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过嘛你就慢慢待着吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.22,0:11:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我这样下去真的好吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.29,0:11:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭这样我真的能守护这家伙吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:12.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你似乎有什么烦恼啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不必为烦恼和迷茫感到羞耻。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}曾经的我也是如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗川先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个，就先交给你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:33.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.12,0:12:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果师父不在时你来了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.71,0:12:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看起来有什么烦心事的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.73,0:12:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就把这张卡交给你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六十郎爷爷？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.37,0:12:46.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}师父对我们这些弟子的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还真是什么都看得透啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.47,0:13:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《爷爷给我的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.77,0:13:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是进攻的卡和防守的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:08.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要把这2张用好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.83,0:13:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算对手使出混沌超量也一样》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你干嘛啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你一直板着张苦瓜脸嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}管他什么表情不都行吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.31,0:13:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不行 不适合你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.39,0:13:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 可恶 这次轮到我的回合了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.97,0:13:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)久等了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)喂 太慢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.18,0:13:38.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让人等这么久……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.98,0:13:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊 你这说法。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}璃绪？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了 为了破坏重要之物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.99,0:13:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了破坏一切可憎的龙。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.01,0:13:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.50,0:13:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道 异晶界……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的都湿透了嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.34,0:14:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过多少也恢复点精神了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 难道小鸟你是在担心我？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.98,0:14:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才没有担心呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.67,0:14:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起那个快点回去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去 会感冒……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鳥{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.19,0:14:25.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)是你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.55,0:14:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你对小鸟做了什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界球形场地展开！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.88,0:14:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？ 什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.26,0:15:05.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你究竟是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾名米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 我将成为你决斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后一位对手。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.05,0:15:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)紧急事态发生！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在坐标753检测到异常能量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(快斗)异常能量？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.58,0:15:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(轨道7)是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.78,0:15:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与球形力场极为相似的能量场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可能正在形成。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.90,0:15:55.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:15:59.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会用这种奇怪的机关来对付我们，也就是说{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是异晶人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《异晶人……
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.26,0:16:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说，不干掉这家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就保护不了星光界！》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？害怕了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.59,0:16:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少胡说！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.53,0:16:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 这场决斗你接受了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那还用说！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.38,0:16:27.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 一决胜负！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.61,0:16:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗目标 锁定。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:16:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.62,0:17:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于出现了啊 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.59,0:17:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你能看见我吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是 巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别担心{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 绝对不会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤哥布林德伯格！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.89,0:17:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽召唤成功的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以从手牌特殊召唤1只
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌召唤这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.39,0:17:45.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！刚巴拉骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，巴利安！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.91,0:17:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的哥布林德伯格和
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚巴拉骑士叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.75,0:18:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.82,0:18:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.28,0:18:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.39 希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.82,0:18:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《好！而且我还有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.69,0:18:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}六十郎爷爷给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.47,0:18:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2张卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗我绝对不能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}敌人应该会使用混沌幻影。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果我输了的话……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔就……》
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.03,0:18:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爷爷 不 是师父给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.53,0:18:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 我可不客气了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动装备魔法 超量叠光连锁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备到霍普身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:19:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的超量单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.61,0:19:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会受到你发动的卡片效果的影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.41,0:19:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 这样一来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算对手使用异热同心力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.58,0:19:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤混沌幻影{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也不会被夺走超量单位。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.12,0:19:17.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 真意外啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你居然会用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重视守备的超量叠光连锁。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:24.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一张卡 超量叠光弹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.13,0:19:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自己怪兽区的叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.81,0:19:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手500点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击重视型的卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.22,0:19:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以你的性格 我还以为
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你肯定会选叠放·弹丸呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.15,0:19:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 我要慎重行事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:46.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此 不坏的战术…。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.97,0:19:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正合我意 从第1回合
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就召唤出希望皇了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.37,0:20:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.62,0:20:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将这只怪兽特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.79,0:20:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 半月龙 拉迪乌斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:16.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 在对手场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.91,0:20:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有叠放单位的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 由于特殊召唤成功
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其等级变为两倍。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 召唤星间龙 珀耳塞斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽 在我方场上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有等级８的怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.04,0:20:39.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无需解放就可以召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最上级怪兽有２只！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级８的半月龙 拉迪乌斯和
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.77,0:20:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星间龙 珀耳塞斯进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:20:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贯穿宇宙的雄叫啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.06,0:21:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}追溯遥远时光从银河之源 苏醒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.91,0:21:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}显现吧然后 引导我走向胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.107！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.06,0:21:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}银河眼时空龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}第107号的 No.吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.89,0:21:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说 那个梦是……
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.83,0:23:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
